{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15935","headline":"送薛蔓应举 · 王建","name":"送薛蔓应举","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"四海重贡献，珠賮称至珍。\n圣朝开礼闱，所贵集嘉宾。\n若生在世间，此路出常伦。\n一士登甲科，九族光彩新。\n憧憧车马徒，争路长安尘。\n万目视高天，昇者得苦辛。\n况子当少年，丈人在咸秦。\n出门见宫阙，献赋侍朱轮。\n有贤大国丰，无子一家贫。\n男儿富邦家，岂爲荣其身。\n煌煌文明代，俱幸生此辰。\n自顾非国风，难以合圣人。\n子去东堂上，我归南涧滨。\n愿君勤作书，与我山中邻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15935.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15935","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}